<BaseLayout lang="en" title="Join | Research AI Commons"><section class="section"><div class="container prose"><div class="eyebrow">Join</div><h1 style="font-size:clamp(2.5rem,6vw,4.7rem)">You do not need<br/>to be an AI expert.</h1><p class="lead">Whether you use AI every day, only for language editing, or have not yet used it in research, you are welcome.</p><h2>How to participate</h2><p>Follow our official X account for event information and community updates.</p><p><a class="button" href={site.x} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Follow us on X <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></p><h2>Want to help organize?</h2><p>You can propose a Café topic, give a lightning talk, recommend a Forum speaker, help with the website, or contribute in other ways.</p></div></section></BaseLayout>
